  "title": "Chocolate Chip Banana Bread I",
  "description": "A delicious moist banana bread with chocolate chips. It can also be baked in 5 greased and floured 3 x 5 inch mini loaf pans.",
  "authors": [
    "SABRINATEE"
  ],
